 ;; ── rollout: the rule applies to the WHOLE roster ──
 ;; The 6 specs above are exemplars. Every actor in the roster (Status § Tier-B actors) MUST grow a
 ;; spec here (or in orgs/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-<name>/system.edn) + embed the reward primitive. Coverage is
 ;; measured by `bb ieflow:coverage`; un-specced actors fall back to :default-weights + the invariants
 ;; (so the rule is never violated by omission — only under-tuned). Live per-actor measurement comes
 ;; from the actor's own `embed` verbs (record!/beat!), G7-gated; until then specs use the
 ;; representative boundary seed (etzhayyim.ie-flow.boundary).
 :rollout "FULL ROSTER specced (100%, loop iter4). Next: refine the few `neutral (telos pending)` weights
  as each actor's purpose is confirmed, and replace representative seeds with live `embed` measurement
  (G7). Coverage is tracked; the gates are never weakened; new actors inherit defaults+invariants."}
